[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2721877110","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100696#issuecomment-2721877110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100696","id":2721877110,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iPIx2","user":{"login":"3lis4","id":45194613,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTk0NjEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45194613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4","html_url":"https://github.com/3lis4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-13T16:24:23Z","updated_at":"2025-03-13T16:24:23Z","body":"This issue still exists in 4.4-stable.\n\nI've made another MRP for 4.4-stable. The AudioStreamPlayer bus is \"PitchBus\", which makes it sound \"higher\".\n\n[MRP_Bus_changes_on_web_exports.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19232838/MRP_Bus_changes_on_web_exports.zip)\n\nSteps to reproduce :\n- if you launch the game in editor, you'll hear the music with a high pitch,\n- if you launch the game on a local server using Remote Deploy > Run in browser, you won't hear the high pitch, but you'll hear the normal pitch instead, probably because AudioStreamPlayer plays on Master bus instead of PitchBus.\n\n@adamscott I think this issue might interest you as you've worked on similar issues. (Please tell me if I shouldn't ping you).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2721877110/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2722564879","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100696#issuecomment-2722564879","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100696","id":2722564879,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iRwsP","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-13T20:01:39Z","updated_at":"2025-03-13T20:05:43Z","body":"> This issue still exists in 4.4-stable.\n> \n> I've made another MRP for 4.4-stable. The AudioStreamPlayer bus is \"PitchBus\", which makes it sound \"higher\".\n> \n> [MRP_Bus_changes_on_web_exports.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19232838/MRP_Bus_changes_on_web_exports.zip)\n> \n> Steps to reproduce :\n> \n>     * if you launch the game in editor, you'll hear the music with a high pitch,\n> \n>     * if you launch the game on a local server using Remote Deploy > Run in browser, you won't hear the high pitch, but you'll hear the normal pitch instead, probably because AudioStreamPlayer plays on Master bus instead of PitchBus.\n> \n> \n> [@adamscott](https://github.com/adamscott) I think this issue might interest you as you've worked on similar issues. (Please tell me if I shouldn't ping you).\n\nThe behavior you're experiencing, @3lis4, is intended. Please read [the blog post I wrote on the subject](https://godotengine.org/article/progress-report-web-export-in-4-3/#sample-playback-to-the-rescue). Starting from 4.3, the Web platform uses samples instead of streams by default. Unfortunately, for now, bus effects aren't yet supported.\n\nIf you absolutely need the bus effect, please use the stream playback type.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5566bc84-892b-4b68-84ec-7a9caed2a84d)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2722564879/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2722595670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100696#issuecomment-2722595670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100696","id":2722595670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iR4NW","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-13T20:15:53Z","updated_at":"2025-03-13T20:15:53Z","body":"@TinyTakinTeller I don't understand the link between the new argument with the issue, though.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2722595670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2746233798","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100696#issuecomment-2746233798","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100696","id":2746233798,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jsDPG","user":{"login":"TinyTakinTeller","id":155020210,"node_id":"U_kgDOCT1rsg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155020210?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller","html_url":"https://github.com/TinyTakinTeller","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-23T14:01:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-23T14:01:28Z","body":"> [@TinyTakinTeller](https://github.com/TinyTakinTeller) I don't understand the link between the new argument with the issue, though.\n\nYeah I'm not sure, perhaps a coincidence it was added then and there - but seems it can be used as a workaround for now, as mentioned.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2746233798/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751443933","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100696#issuecomment-2751443933","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100696","id":2751443933,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j_7Pd","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.c