t shouldn't the web and desktop version act the same when calling `.play_stream` function ?\n\n(Instead of one case using the player's bus and the other case using master bus, if no bus is provided.)\n\nThe \"no bus provided\" case falls back to different defaults (web vs desktop), but documentation states master bus as default argument. Hence the issue title \"Wrong Bus in Web Export Only.\" (See MRP.)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751453201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751518257","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100696#issuecomment-2751518257","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100696","id":2751518257,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kANYx","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T14:47:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T14:47:12Z","body":"I'll take a look again.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751518257/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751534043","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100696#issuecomment-2751534043","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100696","id":2751534043,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kARPb","user":{"login":"TinyTakinTeller","id":155020210,"node_id":"U_kgDOCT1rsg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155020210?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller","html_url":"https://github.com/TinyTakinTeller","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T14:51:42Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T14:53:38Z","body":"\n> [@TinyTakinTeller](https://github.com/TinyTakinTeller) I don't understand the link between the new argument with the issue, though.\n\nSorry If I misspoke earlier, the relevance of the new arguments is, that if it is left empty, then behaves differently in web and desktop exports (web uses master bus, desktop uses bus that was set in the player) in Godot 4.3. (there is no such argument in 4.2. so there we do not have such inconsistency.)\n\nThe MRP I attached mutes the bus that was set in the player, so the music will be muted only on desktop but not on web export.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751534043/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751551959","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100696#issuecomment-2751551959","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100696","id":2751551959,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kAVnX","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T14:56:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T14:56:28Z","body":"Just realized that I introduced that change. But I don't remember why exactly. And that's unfortunate.\n\nTechnically, if everything works as intended, it's the desktop exports that aren't working properly, as `play_stream` defaults to `&\"Master\"`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751551959/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751569719","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100696#issuecomment-2751569719","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100696","id":2751569719,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kAZ83","user":{"login":"TinyTakinTeller","id":155020210,"node_id":"U_kgDOCT1rsg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155020210?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller","html_url":"https://github.com/TinyTakinTeller","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinyTakinTeller/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T15:01:51Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T15:03:43Z","body":"> Just realized that I introduced that change. But I don't remember why exactly. And that's unfortunate.\n> \n> Technically, if everything works as intended, it's the desktop exports that aren't working properly, as `play_stream` defaults to `&\"Master\"`.\n\nBtw, the old function inherited the bus from the player (but now it should use default from the new argument as `&Master`) so the migration guide should also list this as incompatible? i.e. https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.3.html#audio\n\n_(I initially opened this issue when I was migrating \"Resonate\" plugin from 4.2. to 4.3. as original creators stopped updating it in 4.2.)_","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751569719/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]